# PlayStation system software update servers (PS4 + PS5).
# Blocking these stops console system-software updates; games, patches, the
# store and PSN keep working. Each entry blocks the domain and all subdomains.
#
# update.playstation.net covers every d/f/h<region>01.ps{4,5}.update.playstation.net
# server and al02.cdn.update.playstation.net.
update.playstation.net
# Akamai (edgesuite) update CDN: a01.cdn.update.playstation.org.edgesuite.net
update.playstation.org.edgesuite.net
